{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34435","headline":"顾道士亡弟子奉束帛乞铭於袭美因赋戏赠 · 陆龟蒙","name":"顾道士亡弟子奉束帛乞铭於袭美因赋戏赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"童初真府召爲郎，君与抽毫刻便房。\n亦谓神仙同许郭，不妨才力似班扬。\n比於黄绢词尤妙，酬以霜缣价未当。\n唯我有文无卖处，笔锋销尽墨池荒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}